Description: Web management interface for AllStarLink 3
 A browser-based interface for managing an AllStarLink 3 node server:
 node configuration, interface tuning, diagnostics, backups and the
 Asterisk console. It is served by Apache at /asl-web-ui/ and uses the
 server's Linux accounts (PAM) for login.
